<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 92,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 92,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Friday were 92,000 head, compared with the estimate of 90,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Actual receipts for Saturday were 13,000 head, versus an estimate of 10,000 head. Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts fully steady, instances $0.50 higher than mid-session Friday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    56.50 -57.50	   57.50 -58.50</p>
<p>few			56.00  58.00	   57.00  59.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady.</p>
